19. The business model I'd aim for

Ultimately:

Small events
→ high volume  
→ affordable  
→ fast turnaround

Major events
→ high ticket  
→ packages  
→ deposits  
→ financing

Corporate
→ high ticket  
→ custom quotes  
→ recurring clients

Add-ons
→ increase average order value

Memory Vault
→ recurring revenue

Opportunities
→ creates supply + professional portfolio

Personal loans
→ separate financial product